===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|tǫnn|lang=non}}, from {{proto|gem-pro|tanþs|lang=is}}, from {{proto|ine-pro|h₃dónts|lang=is}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/tʰœnː/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|œnː|lang=is}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|f|tannar|tennur}}

# a [[tooth]]

====Declension====
{{is-decl-noun-f-s3|t|a|nn}}
There also exist the variant plural forms ''tannir'' and ''tönnur'', but these forms are neither original nor considered standard today, and have now become obsolete.

